.TH ENGINE_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_init \- Zero *e, start SDL, open the window and renderer at cfg\->logical_w x logical_h scaled by window_scale, apply vsync and logical presentation, then start the services cfg asks for (assets, save, audio, text, gamepad)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "bool engine_init(Engine *e, const EngineConfig *cfg);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Zero *e, start SDL, open the window and renderer at cfg\->logical_w x logical_h scaled by window_scale, apply vsync and logical presentation, then start the services cfg asks for (assets, save, audio, text, gamepad). Zero fields in cfg take defaults (640x360, scale 2, 60 Hz).
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on success; false if SDL or the window failed. A service failing (no audio device, TTF not built) is logged and leaves e\->has_audio / e\->has_text false.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_run (3),
.BR engine_shutdown (3),
.BR gge\-scenes (7),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
